<title>USA: Boeing names Condit as chairman.</title>
<headline>Boeing names Condit as chairman.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boeing Co said Monday it has elected President and Chief Executive Officer Phil Condit as chairman of the board, effective February 1.</p>
<p>Condit will act as chairman and chief executive. He will also take reponsibility as president although that title will be left vacant.</p>
<p>Boeing said in a statement that current chairman Frank Shrontz, who will turn 65 later this week, will retire on January 31.  Shrontz was named chairman emeritus and will continue as a member of the board of directors.</p>
</text>
